{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53367","headline":"诗偈 一 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"须弥颓，五岳崩，大海竭，十方空。\n乾坤尚纳毛头里，日月犹潜毫相中。\n此是西国那提子，示寂不起现神通。\n妙德啓口问不二，忘言入理显真宗。\n（见吴越释延寿《宗镜录》卷二三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}